<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαι-ηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for oil</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράμια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.114
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					629.48
				</span></i>
			 (Palmyra, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>); <i>of oils</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					60a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ.δρόσος</span>, i.e. oil, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.3
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλον ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				5.535.46
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐν πεδίῳ</span>”
				<i>oil-producing,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					14.933
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>oily</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβάς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				12(2).129.6
			</span></i> (Mytil.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.547
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of bees,
				<i>honied</i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				123.8
			</span></i>.</div>
